  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SO5: WSRC&#x2019;s organizational capacity strengthened.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">5.1: External review of the WSRC through targeted interviews and a SWOT analysis on the basis of which clear goals can be set and weaknesses shown (to be conducted at the end of the project).
 5.2: Trainings carried out on basis of staff needs assessment and a training Plan 2022-2025.
50% of staff trained.
 5.3: Implement MoU between WSRC and PWA, 12 meetings for the 6 working committees are held and documented.</narrative>
  </description>
