   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Trainings carried out on basis of staff needs assessment and a training Plan 2022-2025.
50% of staff are trained.</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assessments were made during former years but never properly documented. This, however, is not a proper structural way of developing the capacities of the staff of the WSRC. 
A number of training programs were completed and reported. The trainings included: Excel, benchmarking, wastewater treatment, M&amp;E, etc. During the first program year, fifty percent of the WSRC staff were trained in one or more of these topics. This included 4 staff members out of 8 at that time.</narrative>
   </description>
