  <result aggregation-status="0" type="3">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">WSRC implemented targeted training programs last year to build staff capacity in key priority areas</narrative>
   </title>
   <description>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Based on the strategic plan and the team needs assessment, WSRC implemented targeted training programs last year to build staff capacity in key priority areas. Staff participated in specialized courses including Generative AI for workplace professionals, digital advocacy and content creation, sustainability monitoring for regional water facilities, and Integrated Water Resources Management (IWRM). These trainings aligned with strategic goals by enhancing digital skills, strengthening financial and environmental sustainability planning, and improving technical capacity in water governance. The knowledge gained directly supports the implementation of the strategic plan and advances WSRC&#x2019;s institutional development.</narrative>
   </description>
